//! Returns the tangent of the number in radians passed
/**
    @param value the angle in radians

    @return the tangent of the number in radians passed

    @par Example:
    @code{.py}
number x = tan(y);
    @endcode

    @note an infinite argument gives NaN, with no exception; see @ref undefined_arithmetic
 */
number tan(number value) [flags=TOTAL,HOST_PORTABLE,NAMED_ARGS] {
